{{harvnb |Davis |2011 |p=6}}</ref> The [[United Nations Special Committee on Palestine]] (UNSCOP) was created, and in September, it submitted a report to the [[UN General Assembly]] recommending partition.<ref>{{harvnb |Pappe |2022 |p=115 and 119}};
