In early April 1948, the Israelis launched [[Plan Dalet]], a large-scale offensive to capture land and empty it of Palestinian Arabs.<ref>{{harvnb |Manna |2022 |ps=, pp. 106 ("Simultaneously with the arrival of quality weapons from Prague, Ben-Gurion began implementing Plan Dalet which caused hundreds of casualties among the Palestinians.") and 107 ("the ethnic cleansing policy, which had entered a decisive phase in April")}};
