== Post-1948 Nakba ==

=== Martial law period (1949–1966) ===
[[File:1947-UN-Partition-Plan-1949-Armistice-Comparison.svg|thumb|right|upright|alt=Map comparing the borders of the 1947 partition plan and the Armistice Demarcation Lines of 1949.|{{Partition Plan-Armistice Lines comparison map legend}}]]
